  "body": "Open Homes Saturday and Sunday 12.00 to 12.30\r\n MORE PHOTOS TO FOLLOW\r\n- 1925 bungalow with a distinctive modern renovation\r\n- Owned by an architect  since 1987\r\n- Thoughtfully reworked with a creative eye and individual style\r\n- Stained plywood throughout adds warmth and an artistic edge\r\n- Soaring ceilings and timber floors retain the bungalow's character\r\n- Excellent indoor-outdoor flow to a private, west-facing entertaining area\r\n- Enjoy the Devonport lifestyle, with village cafés, shops, waterfront walks and ferry connections to the city\r\n- Entry level to Devonport, an opportunity with personality and flair\r\n\r\nAuction 10th December at 12.00pm (Unless Sold Prior) In Rooms, 128 Hurstmere Road, Takapuna\r\nTo download property files please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/8Q6L",
